% backend: none
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: the UseCIEColor page-device key (PLRM3 section 6.2.5) is
% accepted and read back; the remapping it asks for is not performed.
<< /UseCIEColor true >> setpagedevice
currentpagedevice /UseCIEColor get ==
